<title>USA: Panhandle Royalty elects Jerry Smith chairman.</title>
<headline>Panhandle Royalty elects Jerry Smith chairman.</headline>
<dateline>OKLAHOMA CITY 1997-03-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Panhandle Royalty Co said directors on Friday elected Jerry L. Smith as chairman.</p>
<p>It said the decision came after Dean Brown announced at the annual organizational meeting after the shareholders meeting that he would not seek re-election for the post.</p>
<p>There were no other changes of officers and none are anticipated.</p>
<p>Smith, 56, has been a director of Panhandle since 1987.</p>
